<title>HONG KONG: SGA sets call warrants on China Light.</title>
<headline>SGA sets call warrants on China Light.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-05-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Societe Generale Acceptance NV (SGA) said on Monday it has issued 90 million American style call warrants on shares of China Light &amp; Power Co Ltd.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	HK$39	   PREMIUM	 14.5 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 HK$0.565	GEARING	 6.90x</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  26.MAY.98     EXER LOT	5,000</p>
<p> LISTING	     HONG KONG</p>
<p> SPOT		  HK$39</p>
<p> NOTE		  CASH OR STOCK DELIVERY AT ISSUER'S OPTION</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
